{"seq":3,"slug":"drug-interactions","title":"大学药学 — 药物相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/drug-interactions","wordCount":2102,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-药物相互作用\">大学药学 — 药物相互作用</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>药物相互作用（Drug-Drug Interactions，DDI）是指两种或多种药物联合使用时，一种药物改变另一种药物的药动学或药效学特性，导致疗效增强、减弱或产生新的不良反应。随着多药联合治疗方案的普遍使用，DDI 已成为临床用药安全的重大挑战。据统计，同时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 种以上药物时，DDI 发生概率可超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>。药师在识别和管理药物相互作用中承担着不可替代的核心职责。</p>\n<p>关键分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>药动学相互作用</strong>：影响 ADME 过程，改变血药浓度</li>\n<li><strong>药效学相互作用</strong>：在受体或效应器水平的协同或拮抗</li>\n<li><strong>药剂学相互作用（配伍禁忌）</strong>：混合后发生物理化学变化</li>\n<li><strong>食物-药物相互作用</strong>：食物成分影响药物吸收或代谢</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-药动学层面的相互作用\">一、药动学层面的相互作用</h3><p><strong>吸收阶段的相互作用</strong>：</p>\n<p>胃肠道 pH 的改变可以显著影响弱酸/弱碱药物的吸收。质子泵抑制剂（如奥美拉唑）使胃内 pH 升高至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\sim 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>，导致需要酸性环境溶解的药物（如酮康唑、铁剂）吸收大幅减少。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>螯合/吸附</td>\n<td>四环素 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Ca</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ca}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ca</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/抗酸剂</td>\n<td>形成不溶性螯合物，吸收下降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pH 改变</td>\n<td>奥美拉唑 + 酮康唑</td>\n<td>酮康唑溶解度降低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AUC</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AUC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AUC</span></span></span></span></span></span> 减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P-gp 抑制</td>\n<td>维拉帕米 + 地高辛</td>\n<td>抑制肠道外排，地高辛吸收增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胃排空加速</td>\n<td>甲氧氯普胺 + 对乙酰氨基酚</td>\n<td>加速达峰，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 升高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>代谢阶段的相互作用（最常见、最危险）</strong>：</p>\n<p>CYP450 酶的诱导和抑制是代谢性 DDI 的主要机制：</p>\n<p><strong>酶抑制</strong>：一种药物抑制 CYP450 酶活性，导致另一种药物代谢减慢、血药浓度升高。效应通常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天内出现。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>酮康唑（CYP3A4 强抑制剂）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>辛伐他汀</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>辛伐他汀 AUC 升高 10-15 倍</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>横纹肌溶解风险</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{酮康唑（CYP3A4 强抑制剂）} + \\text{辛伐他汀} \\rightarrow \\text{辛伐他汀 AUC 升高 10-15 倍} \\rightarrow \\text{横纹肌溶解风险}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">酮康唑（</span><span class=\"mord\">CYP3A4 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">强抑制剂）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">辛伐他汀</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">辛伐他汀</span><span class=\"mord\"> AUC </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">升高</span><span class=\"mord\"> 10-15 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">倍</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">横纹肌溶解风险</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>酶诱导</strong>：一种药物诱导 CYP450 酶表达增加，加速另一种药物代谢，降低其血药浓度。效应通常需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 周才完全显现。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>利福平（CYP3A4 强诱导剂）</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>口服避孕药</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>雌激素代谢加速</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>避孕失败</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{利福平（CYP3A4 强诱导剂）} + \\text{口服避孕药} \\rightarrow \\text{雌激素代谢加速} \\rightarrow \\text{避孕失败}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">利福平（</span><span class=\"mord\">CYP3A4 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">强诱导剂）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">口服避孕药</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">雌激素代谢加速</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">避孕失败</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>主要 CYP450 同工酶的常见底物、抑制剂和诱导剂：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CYP 酶</th>\n<th>重要底物</th>\n<th>抑制剂</th>\n<th>诱导剂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CYP3A4</td>\n<td>辛伐他汀、环孢素、咪达唑仑</td>\n<td>酮康唑、伊曲康唑、红霉素</td>\n<td>利福平、卡马西平、苯妥英</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CYP2D6</td>\n<td>美托洛尔、氟西汀、可待因</td>\n<td>帕罗西汀、奎尼丁</td>\n<td>（几乎不可被诱导）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CYP2C9</td>\n<td>华法林、苯妥英、格列本脲</td>\n<td>氟康唑、胺碘酮</td>\n<td>利福平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CYP2C19</td>\n<td>奥美拉唑、氯吡格雷</td>\n<td>奥美拉唑（自身抑制）</td>\n<td>利福平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CYP1A2</td>\n<td>茶碱、咖啡因、氯氮平</td>\n<td>环丙沙星、氟伏沙明</td>\n<td>吸烟、烤肉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>排泄阶段的相互作用</strong>：</p>\n<p>丙磺舒通过竞争性抑制有机阴离子转运体（OAT）的肾小管分泌，延缓青霉素的肾排泄，使其半衰期延长——这是一个被有意利用的有益 DDI。相反，锂盐与噻嗪类利尿剂合用时，利尿剂减少钠排泄导致肾小管代偿性增加锂的重吸收，引发锂中毒。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-药效学层面的相互作用\">二、药效学层面的相互作用</h3><p><strong>协同作用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>磺胺甲噁唑</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>甲氧苄啶</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>序贯阻断叶酸合成通路</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>协同抗菌</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{磺胺甲噁唑} + \\text{甲氧苄啶} \\rightarrow \\text{序贯阻断叶酸合成通路} \\rightarrow \\text{协同抗菌}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">磺胺甲噁唑</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">甲氧苄啶</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">序贯阻断叶酸合成通路</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">协同抗菌</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是经典的序贯阻断协同——磺胺抑制二氢叶酸合成酶，甲氧苄啶抑制二氢叶酸还原酶，两者联合使抗菌效力成倍增强。</p>\n<p><strong>拮抗作用</strong>：</p>\n<p>功能性拮抗在临床上既可能有害也可能有益。组胺引起支气管痉挛时，肾上腺素通过激活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 受体松弛平滑肌，两者不作用于同一受体但在功能上对抗——这是功能拮抗的经典应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[药效学相互作用] --&gt; B[协同作用]&#10;    A --&gt; C[拮抗作用]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[相加: 1+1=2]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[增强: 1+1&gt;2]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[竞争性拮抗]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[非竞争性拮抗]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[功能性拮抗]&#10;    C --&gt; C4[化学性拮抗]\">graph TD\n    A[药效学相互作用] --&gt; B[协同作用]\n    A --&gt; C[拮抗作用]\n    B --&gt; B1[相加: 1+1=2]\n    B --&gt; B2[增强: 1+1&gt;2]\n    C --&gt; C1[竞争性拮抗]\n    C --&gt; C2[非竞争性拮抗]\n    C --&gt; C3[功能性拮抗]\n    C --&gt; C4[化学性拮抗]</pre><p><strong>危险的药效学 DDI</strong>：</p>\n<p>5-羟色胺综合征是最危险的药效学 DDI 之一。当两种或多种增强 5-HT 信号的药物合用时（如 SSRI + MAO 抑制剂、SSRI + 曲普坦类），可导致肌阵挛、高热、自主神经功能紊乱，严重时危及生命。</p>\n<p>QT 间期延长也是需要高度警惕的 DDI。多种药物（如红霉素、氟康唑、胺碘酮、氟哌啶醇）都可延长 QT 间期，合用时风险叠加，可诱发尖端扭转型室速（TdP）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-食物-药物相互作用\">三、食物-药物相互作用</h3><p><strong>葡萄柚汁效应</strong>：葡萄柚含有的呋喃香豆素不可逆抑制小肠壁 CYP3A4，导致经此酶代谢的药物（如非洛地平、辛伐他汀、环孢素）口服生物利用度显著升高。单杯葡萄柚汁可使非洛地平的 AUC 增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\% \\sim 300\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300%</span></span></span></span></span>，且效应持续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>72</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">24 \\sim 72</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72</span></span></span></span></span> 小时。</p>\n<p><strong>维生素 K 与华法林</strong>：富含维生素 K 的绿叶蔬菜可对抗华法林的抗凝作用。关键不在于绝对禁止维生素 K 摄入，而在于维持饮食中维生素 K 摄入的稳定。</p>\n<p><strong>酪胺与 MAO 抑制剂</strong>：使用非选择性 MAO 抑制剂的患者，进食富含酪胺的食物（陈年奶酪、红酒、腌制品）可引发高血压危象——酪胺无法被 MAO 降解，大量进入血液循环促使去甲肾上腺素释放。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-ddi-的预测与管理\">四、DDI 的预测与管理</h3><p>临床中管理 DDI 的系统方法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>识别</strong>：利用电子处方系统中的 DDI 警示功能和药物相互作用数据库（如 Lexicomp、Micromedex）</li>\n<li><strong>评估</strong>：判断相互作用的临床显著性——并非所有理论上的 DDI 都会产生临床后果</li>\n<li><strong>管理策略</strong>：<ul>\n<li>替代药物：选择不经相同 CYP 酶代谢的替代方案</li>\n<li>调整剂量：根据 DDI 程度调整受影响药物的剂量</li>\n<li>错开服药时间：针对吸收阶段的相互作用</li>\n<li>增强监测：如华法林合用 CYP2C9 抑制剂时加密 INR 监测</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>患者同时服用华法林和氟康唑后 INR 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.0</span></span></span></span></span>（正常治疗范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0 \\sim 3.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.0</span></span></span></span></span>），出现牙龈出血。解释这一 DDI 的机制并提出处理方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么利福平与口服避孕药合用会导致避孕失败？建议这类患者使用什么替代避孕措施？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>计算题：某药物单用时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AUC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AUC} = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AUC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> ng<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span></span></span></span>h/mL，与 CYP3A4 强抑制剂合用后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AUC</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AUC} = 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AUC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> ng<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⋅</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\cdot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span></span></span></span></span>h/mL。若原始剂量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> mg 每日一次，合用时应如何调整剂量以维持相似的暴露量？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>患者因偏头痛服用舒马曲坦（5-HT 激动剂），同时因抑郁症服用帕罗西汀（SSRI）。分析可能出现的药效学相互作用及其临床表现。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一位正在服用环孢素的移植术后患者非常喜欢喝葡萄柚汁。作为药师，你如何向患者解释风险并给出饮食建议？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《药物相互作用基础与临床》</strong>（蔡卫民主编）：系统介绍 DDI 机制和临床案例</li>\n<li><strong>Lexicomp Drug Interactions</strong>：临床常用的 DDI 查询工具</li>\n<li><strong>FDA Drug Development and Drug Interactions Guidelines</strong>：FDA 关于 DDI 研究的指导原则</li>\n<li><strong>Flockhart CYP450 Drug Interaction Table</strong> (<a href=\"https://drug-interactions.medicine.iu.edu)：印第安纳大学维护的\">https://drug-interactions.medicine.iu.edu)：印第安纳大学维护的</a> CYP450 DDI 表</li>\n<li><strong>Stockley&#39;s Drug Interactions</strong>：全球最权威的药物相互作用参考书</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>药物相互作用是临床多药联合治疗中不可回避的安全问题。CYP450 酶的抑制和诱导是最常见也最具临床意义的 DDI 机制，理解主要同工酶的底物、抑制剂和诱导剂是药师的核心技能。药效学层面的协同和拮抗既可能带来治疗获益（如复方新诺明的序贯阻断），也可能导致严重不良事件（如 5-HT 综合征）。食物-药物相互作用同样不容忽视。作为药学专业人员，应当熟练运用 DDI 数据库和评估工具，为患者提供安全、有效的用药指导。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 药物相互作用","id":"大学药学-药物相互作用"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、药动学层面的相互作用","id":"一-药动学层面的相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"二、药效学层面的相互作用","id":"二-药效学层面的相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"三、食物-药物相互作用","id":"三-食物-药物相互作用"},{"level":3,"text":"四、DDI 的预测与管理","id":"四-ddi-的预测与管理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学药学 — 药效动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/pharmacodynamics"},"next":{"title":"大学药学 — 药物剂型与制剂设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/dosage-forms"}}